===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|rootbeer}}

===Etymology===
The term is attested since before the lifetime of {{w|Charles Elmer Hires}}, but he is widely credited with popularizing it much further than it had previously been; his proprietary beverage was inspired by an earlier {{l|en|root tea}}, and he planned to sell it under that name, but he changed its name to broaden the sales appeal. For more, see Wikipedia at ''{{w|root beer#History|root beer § History}}''.

